    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Harrington are pleased to present 28 Joyce House, a one-bedroom, top floor apartment extending to  c.38 sq.m/409 sq.ft. The property offers an excellent opportunity for a purchaser seeking a home or investment property with scope to refurbish and modernise to their own taste.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is well laid out and comprises an entrance hallway, a generously proportioned living/dining room, kitchen, double bedroom and bathroom. The living benefits from direct access to a private balcony and a pleasant outlook.\r\n\r\nThe bedroom is a good-sized double room with fitted wardrobe storage, while the separate kitchen and bathroom complete the accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe apartment is currently in need of substantial refurbishment and upgrading throughout. Once refurbished, the apartment has the potential to provide a very attractive city-centre home.\r\n\r\nViking Harbour enjoys a highly convenient location, within Dublin City Centre and the wide range of amenities, cafés, restaurants, shops and transport links including bus routes and Red LUAS line, the surrounding area has to offer."
      },
